<item>
            <title>[LU-19125]  move &quot;lfs project&quot; over to parallel &quot;lfs find&quot; infrastructure</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19125</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The &quot;&lt;tt&gt;lfs project&lt;/tt&gt;&quot; command is potentially traversing a large directory tree to get/check/set the project ID on many files.  This would significant improve performance by allowing multiple client threads to process files and directories in parallel.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="90599">LU-19125</key>
            <summary> move &quot;lfs project&quot; over to parallel &quot;lfs find&quot; infrastructure</summary>
